      "id": "18720",
      "key": "SFCC-385",
      "summary": "Gift Card PDP – Purchase Form (Amount Dropdown, Sender/Recipient Fields, Message)",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to customise and purchase a gift card by selecting an amount and entering personalisation details, so that I can send a gift card to myself or someone else.\\n\\nThis component appears on the Gift Card PDP for both physical and digital gift cards. It renders: an amount selection as a searchable dropdown showing fixed denominations ($100, $200, $250, $300, $500) (GC-002, GC-004), a sender name field, a recipient name field, a recipient email address field (with validation to ensure correct email format before Add to Bag — GC-007), an optional personal message field, and an Add to Bag CTA. The sender and recipient may be the same person (GC-008). Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC PDP page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit.\\n\\nNote: this story is currently created in SFCC-17 (Credit Notes & Gift Cards) for speed but should be moved to SFCC-5 (Product Detail Page) as the UI component lives on the PDP surface. Flag for PDP epic pass.\\n\\nDepends on GC-001, GC-002, GC-003, GC-004, GC-007, GC-008. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-5 (PDP epic).",
