      "key": "SFCC-297",
      "summary": "PDP UI — Find in Boutique Button and Slide-In Panel",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper,\nI want \nto find which boutiques have my size in stock directly from the PDP,\nso that\n I can visit a store to try or purchase the item if I prefer not to order online.\nPicture for reference (Figma leading): \nThis story covers the PWA Kit frontend component for Find in Boutique on the PDP. It includes the Find in Boutique button display on eligible products, the modal/flyout UI showing per-boutique stock availability for the selected size, and all boutique availability states. The real-time OMS call to NewStore via MuleSoft and response caching logic are out of scope — covered in \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-308\n . ",
