      "key": "SFCC-273",
      "summary": "PLP Inline Grid Insert – Featured Product",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper, \nI want \nto see a large-format featured product tile inserted within the product grid as I browse, \nso that\n key products are given elevated prominence within my browsing experience.\nReference Image (Figma is leading): \nThis story covers the PWA build of the featured product tile variant of the inline grid insert component. The insert occupies a single large-format slot within the product grid on category pages, spanning 2 product rows in height, with regular product tiles filling the remaining columns alongside it. Multiple inserts on the same page alternate between left and right positioning.\nThe component can be built with mock/hardcoded content at this stage — Contentful integration is covered in SFCC-204.\nThis story is one of three covering the inline grid insert variants.",
