      "key": "SFCC-269",
      "summary": "PLP Inline Grid Insert – Editorial Image",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper, \nI want\n to see a large-format editorial image with supporting text and a CTA inserted within the product grid as I browse, \nso that\n I can discover campaign stories and navigate to related editorial content alongside products.\nReference Image (Figma is leading):\nThis story covers the PWA build of the editorial image variant of the inline grid insert component. The insert occupies a single large-format slot within the product grid on category pages, spanning 2 product rows in height. The adjacent column displays an editorial title, body copy, and an optional CTA link in its upper portion, with regular product tiles below. Multiple inserts on the same page alternate between left and right positioning.\nThe component can be built with mock/hardcoded content at this stage — Contentful integration is covered in SFCC-204.\nThis story is one of three covering the inline grid insert variants.",
