      "key": "SFCC-268",
      "summary": "PDP – Maximum Purchase Quantity – BM Config",
      "description": "As a\n Site Merchandiser, \nI want\n to configure the maximum purchase quantity per customer group, per SKU in BM,\nso that \npurchase limits are enforced consistently across the storefront without requiring a code deployment.\nSFCC enforces a configurable maximum purchase quantity at two levels:\nthe product level (SKU)\nthe customer group level\nThere should be a default value. The default value for these limits is 3 but the default can be changed in the setup by an admin.\nThen the merchandiser can also override the default value on product or customer group level to specify a different limit.\nThis story covers the BM configuration only; enforcement and messaging on the PDP/cart are covered in a separate frontend stories.",
