      "summary": "PDP – Slide Out – Shipping & Returns and Assistance",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to access shipping, returns, and assistance information from the product page without leaving my browsing session, so that I can get the support I need without losing my place on the PDP.\nThe PDP displays two tabs within the product information slide-out: Shipping & Returns and Assistance. Both tabs are content-managed in Contentful and do not require a code deployment to update. The Assistance tab includes links to email, WhatsApp, and a live chat entry point. Live chat is powered by Inside Chat, loaded via GTM through the AddingWell container — Inside Chat configuration, availability logic, and routing are out of SFCC scope and remain with Zimmermann. SFCC is responsible for rendering the Contentful content and any configured URLs; it is not responsible for chat widget behaviour or availability state.",
