      "id": "18299",
      "key": "SFCC-182",
      "summary": "PDP – Notify Me: Marketing Consent Sync to Omneo",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper,\nI want\n my marketing communication preference captured during the Notify Me sign-up to be recorded against my profile,\nso that\n I only receive marketing from Zimmermann based on my explicit consent.\nWhen a shopper submits the Notify Me form and has checked the marketing opt-in checkbox, SFCC syncs this consent preference to Omneo. If a customer profile already exists in Omneo (matched on email), the marketing preference is updated. If no profile exists, a new profile is created. Emarsys picks up from Omneo for any subsequent marketing communications.\nThis story covers the SFCC → Omneo sync only. Email sending is out of scope — see SFCC-149 (Notify Me UI) and the back-in-stock email trigger story.",
