      "summary": "PDP – Slide out - Measmerize Widget & Find My Size CTA",
      "description": "As a \nShopper,\nI want \nto find my recommended size on the product page,\nso that \nI can select the right size with confidence before adding to bag.\nImage for reference (Figma is leading): \nPlease note - the new design of Measmerize is not in our control - Measmerize is responsible for the look and feel within the widget.\nImage of current widget for reference, in case new design is not yet picked up by Measmerize:\nThe PDP always displays a Find My Size CTA. When Measmerize is configured for the product, clicking the CTA opens the Measmerize widget. Where Measmerize is not configured for a product, clicking the CTA opens the SFCC size guide slide-out (covered in related story \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-102\n ).\nOnce Measmerize has generated a size recommendation for the shopper, the shopper can click on Continue and that size will be selected in the PDP.",
