  "id": "18721",
  "key": "SFCC-386",
  "summary": "Gift Card PDP \u2013 Delivery Date Picker (Digital Gift Card, 3-Month Restriction)",
  "description": "As a Shopper, I want to select a future delivery date for a digital gift card using a calendar picker, so that I can schedule the gift card to be sent on a specific date.\\n\\nThis component appears on the Digital Gift Card PDP only, within the purchase form (SFCC-385). It renders as a calendar date picker allowing the customer to navigate between months and select a future delivery date. Dates beyond 3 months from the current date are greyed out and unavailable for selection (GC-006). Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC PDP page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit.\\n\\nNote: this story is currently created in SFCC-17 (Credit Notes & Gift Cards) for speed but should be moved to SFCC-5 (Product Detail Page) as the UI component lives on the PDP surface. Flag for PDP epic pass.\\n\\nDepends on GC-005, GC-006. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-5 (PDP epic), SFCC-385 (Gift Card PDP Purchase Form).",
