      "description": "As a\n Site Admin,\nI want\n to configure the correct locales and URL structure for each of the 8 Zimmermann storefronts in SFCC Business Manager,\nso that\n each storefront serves the correct language(s) and operates on the correct URL path per market.\nThis story is split out from SFCC-48 (8 Storefronts Setup) to allow storefront creation to proceed independently while locale and URL configuration is finalised. \nThis covers locale assignment per storefront, EU multi-language locale setup, and the URL path structure across all 8 storefronts.\nStorefront Name\nSFCC Site ID\nLocale(s)\nURL Path\nAustralia (AU)\nZimmermannAU\nen_AU\n/en-au\nUS Domestic\nZimmermannUS\nen\nRoot URL\n(/us will be redirected to root URL)\nUS International\nZimmermannUSIntl\nen_CA\n/en-ca\nUK (Domestic)\nZimmermannUK\nen_GB\n/uk\nEU (Domestic)\nZimmermannEU\nen_FR (default)\nfr_FR\nit_IT\nes_ES\n/en-eu\n/fr-eu\n/es-eu\n/it-eu\nEU (International)\nZimmermannEUIntl\nen_CH\n/en-ch\nHong Kong (International)\nZimmermannHK\nen_HK\n/hk\nMiddle East (International)\nZimmermannME\nen_AE\n/en-ae",
