      "summary": "Footer – Join Us Email Capture & Registration Modal",
      "description": "As a \nshopper,\nI want \nto enter my email in the footer \"Join Us\" field and complete a sign-up modal with my name,\nso that \nI can register my interest with Zimmermann and receive exclusive offers and personalised experiences.\nImage for reference (Figma leading):\nContext / Notes:\nThe footer displays a \"Join Us\" email input field with a \"Continue\" CTA. On submit, a modal opens collecting First Name, Last Name, and Email. The modal displays privacy consent copy and a link to the Privacy Policy.\nPassing the data to Omneo is handled in a separate integration story (see related issue). Note: post-registration confirmation email is out of scope for SFCC.",
