    {
      "id": "18158",
      "key": "SFCC-100",
      "summary": "Footer Sign-Up – Send Registration Data to Omneo",
      "description": "As a \nshopper who has submitted the footer sign-up modal,\n\n\nI want\n my registration data to be passed to Omneo,\n\n\nso that\n my details are held in the system of record for customer identity and my marketing preferences can be synced.\nContext / Notes:\nOn successful submission of the footer sign-up modal (SFCC-99), SFCC passes the customer's First Name, Last Name, Email, and marketing opt-in preference to Omneo via MuleSoft (HPC-036). Omneo then syncs the preference to Emarsys.\nNote: MuleSoft development is Zimmermann/subcontractor scope — Accenture scope covers the SFCC-side MRT endpoint only.",
      "status": {
